  'Arnow', 'Filipowicz', 'Rogier', 'Hochmeier', 'Vasquez', 'Yankelovich'
]) AS w;
       w        |  dm  | alt  
----------------+------+------
 Smith          | SM0  | XMT
 Schmidt        | XMT  | SMT
 Wagner         | AKNR | FKNR
 Kowalski       | KLSK | KLSK
 Czerny         | SRN  | XRN
