 Caesar         | SSR  | SSR
 Chianti        | KNT  | KNT
 Michael        | MKL  | MXL
 Chorus         | KRS  | KRS
 Architect      | ARKT | ARKT
 Orchestra      | ARKS | ARKS
 Bacher         | PKR  | PKR
 Wachter        | AKTR | FKTR
 Ghislaine      | JLN  | JLN
 Hugh           | H    | H
 Laugh          | LF   | LF
 Gnome          | NM   | NM
 Judge          | JJ   | AJ
 Sugar          | XKR  | SKR
 Island         | ALNT | ALNT
 Jose           | HS   | HS
 Jackson        | JKSN | AKSN
 Villa          | FL   | F
 Pfeiffer       | PFFR | PFFR
 Thomas         | TMS  | TMS
 Xavier         | SF   | SFR
 Zhao           | J    | J
 Bordeaux       | PRT  | PRT
 Dumb           | TM   | TM
 Knight         | NT   | NT
 Wright         | RT   | RT
 Gonzalez       | KNSL | KNSL
 Sanchez        | SNXS | SNKS
 Nowakowski     | NKSK | NKFS
 Anne           | AN   | AN
 Breaux         | PR   | PR
 Van Gogh       | FNKK | FNKK
 Schwarzenegger | XRSN | XFRT
 Campbell       | KMPL | KMPL
 MacGregor      | MKRK | MKRK
 Tchaikovsky    | XKFS | XKFS
 Dvorak         | TFRK | TFRK
 Niece          | NS   | NS
 Resnais        | RSN  | RSNS
 Arnow          | ARN  | ARNF
